  <static seed="1780" source="Contrib/PCC/BasicMath/Decimal/AddSubtractDecimals40.pg">
    <statement><p>Simplify without using a calculator.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 12 - 8.97 }</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="11" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>3.03</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>When doing decimal subtractions, make sure to line up the decimal points. For the integer <m>12</m>, the decimal point is at the end of the number, like in <m>12.00</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{\begin{aligned}[t]
   \amp \phantom{-}12.00 \\
 \amp \underline{-\phantom{1}8.97\phantom{ad}} \\
   \amp \phantom{-}3.03
\end{aligned}
    }</m></p>
</solution>
